{"id":"n15437-1-9","stage":1,"title":"갈아타다 · 换乘","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15437-1-9-1","ko":"길이 너무 막히는데.","zh":"路况太堵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길이","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"막히는데.","meaning":"堵住","explanation":"막히다：堵住；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"막히다","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29777","senseId":"6","lemma":"막히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，路途","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"为了到达一定目的地而经过的空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"23886d293fd13968","term":"막히다","zh":"堵住","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3","entryId":"29777","definition":"由于交通堵塞，车辆无法正常行驶。","pronunciation":["마키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c47a21b93d61663c5dfa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15437-1-9-2","ko":"아까 버스에서 내려서 지하철로 갈아탈 걸 그랬나 봐.","zh":"看来刚才应该从公交车上下来换乘地铁的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스에서","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려서","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내리다：下，下去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지하철로","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈아탈","meaning":"换乘，倒","explanation":"갈아타다：换乘，倒；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"갈아타다","audio":"/audio/575a6beba36e747514ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15437","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈아타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬나","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的交通工具上出来而到某处。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3","entryId":"71490","definition":"行驶在地下铁路的电动车。","pronunciation":["지하철"]},{"id":"575a6beba36e7475","term":"갈아타다","zh":"换乘，倒","audio":"/audio/575a6beba36e747514ee.mp3","entryId":"15437","definition":"从坐着的交通工具上下来，改坐别的交通工具。","pronunciation":["가라타다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/548d18232452e8a10952.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15437","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.8053,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["路况太堵了。","看来刚才应该从公交车上下来换乘地铁的。","这根棒子有多长？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["路况太堵了。","看来刚才应该从公交车上下来换乘地铁的。","这根棒子有多长？"],"answer":1}]}
